{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Dg3Jjquher1795755478.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「女神」張曦雯（Kelly）早前在劇集《璀璨之城》中表現亮眼，不少網民大讚她演技大有進步。忙完一輪拍攝工作後，Kelly 終於迎來悠長假期好好充電，日前她便帶著愛犬 Nala 出街享受寫意時光，相約好友朱韻韻到一間露天餐廳用膳開餐。</p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 上午11.32.01.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d73SZ1CgZ81795755478.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>相中見 Nala 相當聽話乖巧地坐在椅上，Kelly 見狀即母愛大發，不但餵零食獎勵，更忍不住肉緊咀嘴牠，人狗互動極具愛心！不過眼利的網民卻發現片中暗藏甜蜜玄機——原來 Kelly 拿出的寵物零食包裝上，竟貼有緋聞對象吳卓羲（Ron）的專屬貼紙！相信這包正是吳卓羲自家品牌出品的寵物健康食品，而早前 Kelly 亦曾大方透露獲對方贈送寵物產品給愛犬享用。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 上午10.41.37.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EXYGVY803w1795755478.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 上午10.41.48.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oizyM0yp0j1795755477.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 上午10.42.09.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VVAZBPtnVt1795755477.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-27 上午10.42.11.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E30hYS4ZOJ1795755477.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鏡頭一轉，Kelly 親自駕車載著 Nala 到郊野公園散步兼欣賞日落美景，Nala在大草地上盡情奔馳放電，一人一狗度過了相當快樂的一日。片段曝光後隨即引來大批網民起哄，笑言 Kelly藉餵愛犬「低調放閃」，紛紛留言：「原來卓羲都有出現」、「隔空放閃真係好 Sweet」、「Nala 好乖呀」！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.439288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":442,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:12.605311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:15.550725+00:00","content_hash":"a63293efc63bda266f664084e7badafd3ffef5725110d1b3199da9d0d4148156","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.439288+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}